		CreateModule "#Goto" "#Barricade" "#Boss=#Barricade" "#Spline=A3C1SS7Drone3" "#count=1" "#maxalive=1" "#addtoradar" "#Type=Barricade" "#SpawnInLosInit" "#SpawnAsCreature" "#KeyLocation=On" "#BlockDeath" "#Script=LeapPunch" "#ForcePlayerAsOpp" "#SetEnergyMin=2.0"
		
